OL,3,GNEWSAPolice make arrest in rape
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating reports of a rape
OL,7,Fnear a rail line in Nottinghamshire
OL,8,Fhave made an arrest.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Clay Lane,
OL,11,FNewark, after a woman was attacked at
OL,12,Fabout 15:00 GMT on 18 November.
OL,14,FNottinghamshire Police said a man was
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of rape on Monday
OL,16,Fand has been bailed with strict
OL,17,Fconditions.
OL,19,FThe force added that the woman is still
OL,20,Fbeing supported by specially-trained
OL,21,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
